flowchart TD
  A([Start])
  B[Get the number of textbooks and what one textbook weighs]
  C[Get the student's own weight]
  D[Work out the backpack weight: books times the weight of one]
  E[Work out the guideline: one tenth of the student's weight]
  F{Is the backpack weight at or under the guideline?}
  G[Report that the backpack is a safe weight]
  H[Report that the backpack is over the guideline]
  Z([End])
  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
  D --> E
  E --> F
  F -->|yes| G
  F -->|no| H
  G --> Z
  H --> Z
